{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Reach Out — {{BUSINESS_NAME}} Contact</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach the team to join the next cohort, ask about private sound sessions, or try a short guided mini-practice." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1724; /* deep navy */
      --accent:#8bd3c7; /* seafoam */
      --accent-2:#ffd66b; /* warm gold */
      --muted:#9aa4b2;
      --card:#0b1220;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --round:14px;
      --maxw:1020px;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#071023);color:#eaf6f3}
    a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:28px auto;padding:28px;position:relative}
    /* Diagonal split hero */
    .hero{
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:stretch;gap:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(0,0,0,0.06));padding:26px;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;
      box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);
    }
    .diag{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background-image:url("assets/img/pattern.svg");opacity:0.09;mix-blend-mode:screen}
    .left{padding:30px 28px 30px 40px}
    .brand{font-size:14px;color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em}
    h1{margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05;color:#f6fff8}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:48ch}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
    nav a{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;color:#dff3ee}
    /* contact card */
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:#eaf6f3}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7be4bb);color:#042526;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--accent);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}
    /* right column widgets */
    .right{padding:24px}
    .widget{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(0,0,0,0.03));padding:16px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
    .label-inline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .seat-map{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,28px);gap:8px;justify-content:start;margin-top:12px}
    .seat{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .seat.taken{background:#2a3943;color:#223;opacity:0.7}
    .seat.selected{background:var(--accent);color:#022;text-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2)}
    .packing-list{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .packing-list li{margin:8px 0}
    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:#ffebd1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3b1f00 0%,transparent 100%);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:12px;color:#fff}
    footer{margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    /* modal */
    .modal-wrap{position:fixed;inset:0;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2,6,23,0.6), rgba(2,6,23,0.82));z-index:900}
    .modal{background:#071020;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;max-width:680px;width:94%;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .modal h3{margin:0 0 8px}
    .modal .mcols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 260px;gap:16px}
    .breath-visual{height:160px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(139,211,199,0.06),transparent);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .pulse{width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);opacity:0.12;transform:scale(1);transition:transform 1s ease,opacity 1s ease}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .tiny{font-size:13px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:820px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .mcols{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .seat-map{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,26px)}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero" role="banner">
      <div class="diag" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="left">
        <div class="brand">Community Cohorts — sound & ritual</div>
        <h1>Let's schedule your next cohort spot or a private gathering</h1>
        <p class="lead">Reach our team for cohort enrollment, bespoke private sessions, or quick questions. Try a short guided micro-practice below to feel the approach before you commit.</p>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="index.html">Home</a>
          <a href="events.html">Events</a>
          <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
          <a href="about.html">About</a>
          <a href="book.html">Book</a>
          <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div class="right">
        <div class="card">
          <strong style="display:block">Contact the team — quick form</strong>
          <form id="contactForm" class="form" onsubmit="return submitForm(event)">
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First & last" required />
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required />
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px">
              <label for="note">Message — quick note (optional)</label>
              <textarea id="note" name="note" placeholder="Tell us which cohort or how we can help"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <button type="button" class="secondary" onclick="openModal('guided')">Try it now</button>
              <a class="secondary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="margin-left:auto">Quick book</a>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> · <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="widget" aria-labelledby="seatsTitle">
          <div class="label-inline">
            <div>
              <div id="seatsTitle" style="font-weight:700">Choose an upcoming cohort</div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">See fast availability and pick a seat</div>
            </div>
            <select id="eventSelect" aria-label="Select event" onchange="loadSeatMap()">
              <option value="2026-03-07">Mar 7 · Evening: Sound Cohort — 6:30pm</option>
              <option value="2026-03-14">Mar 14 · Afternoon: Gentle Wave — 2:00pm</option>
              <option value="2026-03-21">Mar 21 · Morning: Reset Cohort — 10:00am</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="seat-map" id="seatMap" role="grid" aria-label="Seat selector"></div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
            <button class="tiny" onclick="reserveSeat()">Reserve seat (local)</button>
            <button class="tiny" onclick="clearSelection()">Clear</button>
            <div style="margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)"><span id="availableCount">—</span> seats open</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="widget">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Packing and arrival suggestions</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px">Generate a short list tailored to how you plan to attend.</div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
            <label style="flex:1">
              <div class="label-inline"><span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">I will bring a mat</span><input id="bringMat" type="checkbox" style="margin-left:8px" checked/></div>
            </label>
            <label style="flex:1">
              <div class="label-inline"><span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">I want cushions</span><input id="bringPillows" type="checkbox" style="margin-left:8px"/></div>
            </label>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
            <label style="flex:1">
              <div class="label-inline"><span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">I arrive early</span><input id="arriveEarly" type="checkbox" style="margin-left:8px"/></div>
            </label>
            <label style="flex:1">
              <div class="label-inline"><span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">I prefer blankets</span><input id="wantBlanket" type="checkbox" style="margin-left:8px"/></div>
            </label>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <button class="tiny" onclick="generateList()">Make packing list</button>
            <div style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px" id="packingHint">Ready</div>
          </div>
          <ul class="packing-list" id="packingList" aria-live="polite"></ul>
        </div>

        <div class="widget">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Health & safety — brief note</div>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">If you have epilepsy, severe cardiovascular conditions, recent surgery, or are pregnant, please consult your healthcare provider before participating. If in doubt, contact our team and we will work with you to find a safe option.</p>
        </div>

        <footer>
          <div style="font-size:13px">We run cohort programs focused on small-group rhythm and shared timing. This is a cohort-based offering — if you need private timing, select the Private link above.</div>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal: guided micro-practice -->
  <div id="modal" class="modal-wrap" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px">
        <h3 id="modalTitle">Try a quick micro-practice</h3>
        <button class="secondary" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>
      </div>
      <div class="mcols">
        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;align-items:center">
            <select id="practiceType" onchange="switchPractice()">
              <option value="breath">Guided breathing</option>
              <option value="journ">Timed journaling</option>
              <option value="intent">Intention setting</option>
            </select>
            <input id="practiceDuration" type="number" min="1" max="15" value="3" style="width:72px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:#eaf6f3" aria-label="Duration in minutes"/> <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">min</span>
            <div style="margin-left:auto" id="practiceState" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </div>

          <div id="practiceArea">
            <!-- breath visual -->
            <div id="breathBox" style="display:block">
              <div class="breath-visual" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="pulse" id="pulse"></div>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
                <button class="btn" onclick="startBreath()">Start breathing</button>
                <button class="secondary" onclick="stopBreath()">Stop</button>
                <div style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Cycle: <span id="breathCycle">0</span></div>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Simple triangle breath: inhale — hold — exhale. Follow the pulse.</div>
            </div>

            <!-- journaling -->
            <div id="journBox" style="display:none">
              <div style="margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--muted)">Timed prompt: notice one feeling, one physical sensation, and one small intention.</div>
              <textarea id="journText" placeholder="Begin typing — your note stays local to this page"></textarea>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;align-items:center">
                <button class="btn" onclick="startJourn()">Start timer</button>
                <button class="secondary" onclick="saveJourn()">Save locally</button>
                <div style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Time left: <span id="journTimer">—</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- intention -->
            <div id="intentBox" style="display:none">
              <div style="margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--muted)">Small intention scaffolds to choose from — pick one and refine it.</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
                <button class="secondary tiny" onclick="pickIntent('I will arrive curious')">I will arrive curious</button>
                <button class="secondary tiny" onclick="pickIntent('I will soften my shoulders')">I will soften my shoulders</button>
                <button class="secondary tiny" onclick="pickIntent('I will listen without fixing')">I will listen without fixing</button>
              </div>
              <input id="intentText" type="text" placeholder="Your intention" />
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
                <button class="btn" onclick="confirmIntent()">Set intention</button>
                <button class="secondary" onclick="clearIntent()">Clear</button>
                <div style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Status: <span id="intentStatus">none</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.015);padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
          <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">How it works</div>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">This small tool is a sample of the cohort pacing: gentle timing cues, brief reflection, and an invitation to notice. All activity stays local to your browser unless you purposely save or submit through the contact form above.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(139,211,199,0.06),transparent);padding:8px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Sessions run as small cohorts; this exercise is meant to give you a taste. If you have concerns, see health & safety note on the page.</div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Basic local form handler (fake)
    function submitForm(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name=document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email=document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const note=document.getElementById('note').value.trim();
      alert('Thanks '+(name||'friend')+' — we received your note. We will follow up at '+(email||'your email')+'.');
      document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
      return false;
    }

    // Seat selector: local mock state
    const seatMaps = {};
    function seedSeats(){
      const events=['2026-03-07','2026-03-14','2026-03-21'];
      events.forEach((d,i)=>{
        const total=24; const taken=Math.floor(Math.random()*(10+i*3));
        const arr = new Array(total).fill(0);
        for(let t=0;t<taken;t++) arr[Math.floor(Math.random()*total)]=1;
        seatMaps[d]=arr;
      });
    }
    function loadSeatMap(){
      const sel=document.getElementById('eventSelect').value;
      const map=seatMaps[sel]||[];
      const el=document.getElementById('seatMap');
      el.innerHTML='';
      map.forEach((v,idx)=>{
        const b=document.createElement('button');
        b.className='seat'+(v? ' taken':'');
        b.type='button';
        b.setAttribute('data-idx',idx);
        b.innerText=idx+1;
        b.onclick=()=>toggleSeat(b,sel);
        el.appendChild(b);
      });
      document.getElementById('availableCount').innerText = map.filter(x=>x===0).length;
    }
    function toggleSeat(btn,sel){
      if(btn.classList.contains('taken')) return;
      // exclusive select
      document.querySelectorAll('#seatMap .seat').forEach(s=>s.classList.remove('selected'));
      btn.classList.add('selected');
      document.getElementById('packingHint').innerText='Seat '+btn.dataset.idx+' selected';
    }
    function reserveSeat(){
      const sel=document.getElementById('eventSelect').value;
      const selected=document.querySelector('#seatMap .seat.selected');
      if(!selected){alert('Pick a free seat first.');return}
      const idx=parseInt(selected.getAttribute('data-idx'));
      // mark as taken locally
      seatMaps[sel][idx]=1;
      alert('Local reservation saved for '+sel+' — seat '+(idx+1)+'. This is a demo reservation stored in the page session.');
      loadSeatMap();
    }
    function clearSelection(){
      document.querySelectorAll('#seatMap .seat').forEach(s=>s.classList.remove('selected'));
      document.getElementById('packingHint').innerText='Ready';
    }

    // Packing list generator
    function generateList(){
      const list=[];
      const bringMat=document.getElementById('bringMat').checked;
      const bringPillows=document.getElementById('bringPillows').checked;
      const arriveEarly=document.getElementById('arriveEarly').checked;
      const wantBlanket=document.getElementById('wantBlanket').checked;
      if(bringMat) list.push('Your mat (folded) — labeled if you keep it here')
      else list.push('Request a mat on arrival (limited)')
      if(bringPillows) list.push('One or two cushions for support')
      if(wantBlanket) list.push('A light blanket for warmth during stillness')
      if(arriveEarly) list.push('Arrival 10–15 min early to settle and choose a seat')
      list.push('A water bottle — sip gently post-session')
      const ul=document.getElementById('packingList'); ul.innerHTML='';
      list.forEach(it=>{ const li=document.createElement('li'); li.textContent=it; ul.appendChild(li); });
      document.getElementById('packingHint').innerText='List made';
    }

    // Modal guided practice
    const modal=document.getElementById('modal');
    let breathInterval=null, breathCycle=0;
    function openModal(type){
      modal.style.display='flex'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
      document.body.style.overflow='hidden';
      if(type) document.getElementById('practiceType').value=type;
      switchPractice();
    }
    function closeModal(){
      modal.style.display='none'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
      document.body.style.overflow='auto';
      stopBreath(); stopJourn();
    }
    function switchPractice(){
      const val=document.getElementById('practiceType').value;
      document.getElementById('breathBox').style.display = val==='breath' ? 'block':'none';
      document.getElementById('journBox').style.display = val==='journ' ? 'block':'none';
      document.getElementById('intentBox').style.display = val==='intent' ? 'block':'none';
      document.getElementById('practiceState').innerText='';
    }

    // Breathing: simple expanding pulse
    function startBreath(){
      stopBreath();
      const dur = Math.max(1, parseInt(document.getElementById('practiceDuration').value)||3);
      const pulse = document.getElementById('pulse');
      breathCycle=0; document.getElementById('breathCycle').innerText = breathCycle;
      let phase=0; // 0 inhale (3s), 1 hold (2s), 2 exhale (3s)
      let counts=0;
      const inhale=3000, hold=2000, exhale=3000;
      function tick(){
        if(phase===0){ pulse.style.transform='scale(1.4)'; pulse.style.opacity='0.24'; }
        else if(phase===1){ pulse.style.transform='scale(1.2)'; pulse.style.opacity='0.18'; }
        else { pulse.style.transform='scale(0.7)'; pulse.style.opacity='0.12'; }
      }
      let totalMs = dur*60*1000; // run timer
      const start = Date.now();
      breathInterval = setInterval(()=>{
        const elapsed=Date.now()-start;
        if(elapsed >= totalMs){ stopBreath(); return; }
        // cycle timing
        const cyclePos = (elapsed % (inhale+hold+exhale));
        const newPhase = cyclePos < inhale ? 0 : (cyclePos < inhale+hold ? 1 : 2);
        if(newPhase!==phase){ phase=newPhase; tick(); }
        // count cycles
        const cyclesDone = Math.floor(elapsed/(inhale+hold+exhale));
        if(cyclesDone!==breathCycle){ breathCycle=cyclesDone; document.getElementById('breathCycle').innerText = breathCycle; }
      }, 200);
      tick(); document.getElementById('practiceState').innerText='Breathing — follow the pulse';
    }
    function stopBreath(){ if(breathInterval){ clearInterval(breathInterval); breathInterval=null; } document.getElementById('practiceState').innerText='Stopped'; document.getElementById('pulse').style.transform='scale(1)'; }

    // Journaling: timer that counts down and stores text into localStorage
    let journTimerId=null; let journEnd=null;
    function startJourn(){ stopJourn(); const min = Math.max(1, parseInt(document.getElementById('practiceDuration').value)||3); const ms = min*60*1000; journEnd = Date.now()+ms; document.getElementById('journTimer').innerText = formatMillis(ms);
      journTimerId = setInterval(()=>{
        const left = journEnd - Date.now();
        if(left<=0){ stopJourn(); document.getElementById('journTimer').innerText='0:00'; alert('Time — take a breath and reread what you wrote.'); return; }
        document.getElementById('journTimer').innerText = formatMillis(left);
      },200);
      document.getElementById('practiceState').innerText='Journaling — write for the time';
    }
    function stopJourn(){ if(journTimerId){ clearInterval(journTimerId); journTimerId=null; } document.getElementById('practiceState').innerText=''; }
    function saveJourn(){ const t = document.getElementById('journText').value.trim(); if(!t){ alert('Write a short note to save.'); return };
      const stamp = new Date().toISOString(); const key = 'micro_journal_'+stamp;
      localStorage.setItem(key, t);
      alert('Saved locally to your browser.');
      document.getElementById('journText').value='';
    }
    function formatMillis(ms){ const s=Math.ceil(ms/1000); const mm=Math.floor(s/60); const ss=String(s%60).padStart(2,'0'); return mm+':'+ss; }

    // Intentions
    function pickIntent(txt){ document.getElementById('intentText').value = txt; }
    function confirmIntent(){ const t=document.getElementById('intentText').value.trim(); if(!t){ alert('Type an intention first.'); return } document.getElementById('intentStatus').innerText = 'Set — "'+t+'"'; }
    function clearIntent(){ document.getElementById('intentText').value=''; document.getElementById('intentStatus').innerText='none'; }

    // initialize
    seedSeats(); loadSeatMap();
    // keyboard escape closes modal
    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key==='Escape'){ closeModal(); } });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact.html and README for sound_bath site

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — the contact page with interactive widgets and local JS
- README.md — this file

Purpose and highlights
- contact.html implements a playful, premium-flavored contact / micro-practice page for a cohort-style sound bath offering.
- Local interactive features (pure JS, no server calls):
  - Event seat selector: mock seat maps for three upcoming cohort dates, selectable seats, and a local 'reserve' function that marks seats taken in page state.
  - Packing list generator: choose preferences (bring mat, cushions, blankets, arrive early) and create a short packing checklist rendered in-page.
  - Guided micro-practice modal: a multi-mode "Try it now" modal providing three practices:
    - Guided breathing: expanding/contracting pulse visual with timed inhale/hold/exhale cycles. Runs locally with a minute-based duration.
    - Timed journaling: start a timer and write in a textarea; saved entries are stored in localStorage if the user chooses to save.
    - Intention setting: pick or write a small intention and set/clear it (stored only in-page).
- Accessibility: basic ARIA attributes for modal, seat grid, and live regions.
- Safety: includes a contraindications disclaimer as required.

Placeholders used (preserved verbatim):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
